                    },
                    "message": "this should check the response of getDbusProperty and have some sort of error return path. Whether that is making this return an std::optional<stdplus::EthAddr> or returning a boost error code and having the EthAddr as a reference, I don't really care. The prior implementation relied upon this function throwing an exception."
